<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta has intensified attacks, bombing a religious ceremony and killing its own prisoners of war in Chin State, and launching an arson spree in Sagaing after a colonel was killed. Thailand has halted unofficial border trade for a week and border villagers in Tak province are seeking protection as artillery shells from Myanmar strike Thai homes. Japan is lobbying to have Myanmar removed from the global financial watchdog's blacklist while the United States is accused of undermining the EU's diplomatic blockade and seeking Myanmar's rare earths. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNOUE1aHhNQ1BkVTZYeHpxQzF3NDU1VzZUN1ozMHFRem81U3Z3YW50NXZ3ZUhxbnkteUdWNlhjY29HQjVOZzR4YjFvRWlid21aby1idno4YWZwbURuQ0lxcHhiaW9uRXZHTm1sWU9zT3FON2hfelBUQjNCcWlrZVRla2RrazU5VXU1dktLUmRiSmpkMkdrczBfcFRYTzhvRm9RRGJCMEo0X2IwWnRtQnVqTWNva28xd1NxalBv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE51bkJ4NHZJZ3ZOYjFQeWJVS3hsOFlHU1BiNWJqMFQycmVUbEpzZWtJZklfYm9ram41b21fNHZOVGhwSGZCN19HZTNkbTdTUEpJQThMdzV6MA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQQWZSRHB2bXRwUk1NSVppZU9lMERoVGk5UEk3MllITkZ6V1lYeFNtYUpuc3pTUTZiMW43UnpVVElpbjFCX3ZpbXJqcFpZaC01VGs1VF9UUmVUd1hwX09YQl9OWklobG8xcExReDExQmZYU1FQZzNrcUdCckliZ2wyTW5KUWhfa3V1N2NXdDB5bWVsc0x2UEdIemNYdDRuMWpRN0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Myanmar Now&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE9SZ09CVUZ1eFV3N0FCaFhzLXpTUDRnTF9saWNDTE1wZkV0T3p4MlhpNTlSMndSY2hKdGh2NDFTX0tJVkt0bl8xdGQ0ZGlzWlNLMVctM0lTU2FCVGRX?oc=5&quot;&gt;Responsible Statecraft&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.